  5c733d8ad9900834 t("On a handheld a control leaves 12, 14 and 16px at its ends, by its size, where a desk's leaves 8, 12 and 16. The 14 isn't a step of space, though every space is to be one, and the spec says space is the same at both reaches, which a small control's 12 doesn't hold to either. A regular control is the proposal's Another round and Send.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(24,87) s(720,hug:67.5) f[(2f6ccba95ba03f12,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Between"
