  dbde4f4fd0604a3a t("An icon set among text is to be about as big as the text: small among a detail's or code's, and regular among body text. At a desk they're the text's sizes exactly, 12 and 14px. On a handheld a detail is 15px and body text 17px, and the icons are 14 and 18px, one a pixel under its text and one a pixel over.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(24,87) s(720,hug:67.5) f[(2559553a402043ce,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Between"
