      b1bab7316a6247cf t("Exact, as at a desk. A small icon among code's 14px is a pixel bigger than it. Two values in the code, and two sizes and their lines' widths in the design. 19 of the iPhone's 30 pictures move by a pixel, such as a row's chevron and the top bar's, and none at a desk.",SF Pro Text,12,r,align(l),lh(1.625),ls(0px)) p(0,159.51) s(fill,hug:97.5) ext(300,) f[(3170d989067b6f26,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Detail "Cost"
