  a141adbcd9195dfd t("A bar is to hold buttons of its own size, with room above and below them. On a handheld a small bar is 36px with the edge under it, and a small button 32px, so it has 1.5px above and below, where a test that runs only at a desk asks for 2. On a handheld only a banner takes a small bar's height, as its least, and a banner is already 40px tall, since it sets a small button's line with 4px above and below. So nothing on screen moves either way.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(24,87) s(720,hug:90) f[(bb7261a2ec6c2c45,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Between"
